# What must never be published with the site. The publish step is `git add .`, so anything a
# static host would serve but that is not part of the site belongs here. tools/check_site.py
# ("stray" check) fails when one of these kinds of file sits in the folder unlisted.

# verify.sh output (screenshots, print PDF): it defaults to a temp folder outside the site now
qa/

# the owner's private planning document; publishing it is the owner's call, not a build step
Senior-Data-Analytics-Portfolio-Blueprint.pdf

# the retired v1 page's data (mislabelled series, in-sample error); kept only for the v1 driver
# profile in tools/check_driver.py
demo-data.json

# local clutter
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
